{"title":"Mathematics careers","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>There are many mathematics careers besides <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematician\" title=\"Mathematician\">mathematician</a>.\n</p><p>To discuss mathematics careers, visit the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=338\">Careers in Mathematics Forum</a> sponsored by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.janestcapital.com/\">Jane St. Capital</a>.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_mathematics_careers\">List of mathematics careers</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_careers&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: List of mathematics careers\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This list should be consider a <i>partial</i> list.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Actuary&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Actuary (page does not exist)\">Actuary</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cryptographer&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Cryptographer (page does not exist)\">Cryptographer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Engineer\" title=\"Engineer\">Engineer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Epidemiologist&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Epidemiologist (page does not exist)\">Epidemiologist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Financial_analyst&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Financial analyst (page does not exist)\">Financial analyst</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Financial_trader&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Financial trader (page does not exist)\">Financial trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematician\" title=\"Mathematician\">Mathematician</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_teacher&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Mathematics teacher (page does not exist)\">Mathematics teacher</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quantitative_analyst&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Quantitative analyst (page does not exist)\">Quantitative analyst</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Statistician\" title=\"Statistician\">Statistician</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_careers&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_books\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Math books\">Math books</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ams.org/employment\">AMS Careers and Employment page</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018033719\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.010 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 18/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1590:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018033719 and revision id 7995. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}